{"id":"attractor","name":"Quaternion Julia Attractor","description":"A ray-marched 3D quaternion Julia strange attractor (z → z² + c). Short multi-agent replay where the Testers catch a resolution-scaling bug and the Coder fixes it — ending in the interactive attractor.","language":"javascript_browser","spec":"Build a real-time WebGL visualisation of a quaternion Julia strange attractor: z → z² + c with z, c ∈ ℍ (quaternions), c = (-0.2, 0.6, 0.2, 0.0). Ray-march the set with a distance estimator and sphere tracing; shade with normal-based lighting, soft shadows and ambient occlusion. Provide an animated reveal that grows the structure over ~20s, multiple colour palettes, three colour-temperature lights (key/fill/rim) with softness, a particle-orbit overlay, and camera/quality controls (FOV, iterations, AO, resolution scale, adaptive quality). Single self-contained HTML file, 60 fps target with a graceful WebGL fallback.","duration_seconds":88,"coders":[{"model":"claude-opus-4.5"}],"testers":[{"model":"claude-sonnet-4.5"},{"model":"gemini-2.5-pro"}],"summarizer":{"model":"claude-opus-4.5"},"finalizer":{"model":"claude-opus-4.5"},"events":[{"t":0,"type":"workflow_started"},{"t":0.5,"type":"camera_focus","target":"spec"},{"t":12,"type":"camera_focus","target":"coder_"},{"t":12,"type":"iteration_started","iteration":1},{"t":12,"type":"phase_started","phase":"coding"},{"t":12.2,"type":"agent_started","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0},{"t":13,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ru\">\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>Кватернионный Фрактал Жюлиа</title>"},{"t":16,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"// quaternion Julia: z -> z^2 + c,  c = (-0.2, 0.6, 0.2, 0.0)\nvec2 qSquare(vec4 q){ /* ... */ }\nfloat mapDE(vec3 p, out float trap){ vec4 z = vec4(p,0.0); float dz=1.0; ... }"},{"t":20,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"// sphere-trace the distance estimator\nfor(int i=0;i<512;i++){\n  if(i>=uMarchSteps) break;\n  float d = mapDE(ro+rd*t, trap);\n  if(d<.0002){hit=true;break;} t += d*.7;\n}"},{"t":25,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"// camera ray from FOV + aspect-correct uRes\nvec2 uv=(vUv*uRes-.5*uRes)/uRes.y;\nfloat fl=1./tan(uFOV*PI/360.); vec3 rd=cam*normalize(vec3(uv,fl));"},{"t":29,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"// 3 colour-temperature lights + soft shadows + AO + ACES tonemap\ncol += mc*diff*uLC[li]*uLI[li]*shadow(p+n*.003, uLD[li], ...);"},{"t":32,"type":"agent_completed","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"tokens":9200,"cost":0.46},{"t":34,"type":"camera_focus","target":"tester_"},{"t":34,"type":"phase_started","phase":"testing"},{"t":34.2,"type":"agent_started","agent_type":"tester","agent_index":0},{"t":34.4,"type":"agent_started","agent_type":"tester","agent_index":1},{"t":50,"type":"agent_completed","agent_type":"tester","agent_index":0,"tokens":4200,"cost":0.06,"issuesFound":3},{"t":51,"type":"agent_completed","agent_type":"tester","agent_index":1,"tokens":3900,"cost":0.19,"issuesFound":2},{"t":52,"type":"camera_focus","target":"summarizer_0"},{"t":52,"type":"phase_started","phase":"summarizing"},{"t":52.2,"type":"agent_started","agent_type":"summarizer"},{"t":56,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"summarizer","partial_content":"## Round 1\nSerious: 1 — \"Разрешение 2x\" multiplies on top of devicePixelRatio -> 4x on retina, unbounded buffer -> stalls\nMinor: 2 — adaptive fights the slider; magic numbers"},{"t":59,"type":"agent_completed","agent_type":"summarizer","tokens":2600,"cost":0.16},{"t":60,"type":"camera_focus","target":"coder_0"},{"t":60,"type":"iteration_started","iteration":2},{"t":60,"type":"phase_started","phase":"coding"},{"t":60.2,"type":"agent_started","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0},{"t":62,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"// RES-FIX (iteration 2): resMult is the ABSOLUTE supersample factor —\n// no longer multiplied by min(devicePixelRatio,2), so \"2.0x\" means 2x, not 4x\n// on a retina screen, and the drawing buffer stays bounded.\nconst pr = resMult * adaptiveResFactor;"},{"t":68,"type":"agent_streaming","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"partial_content":"function updateRes(){ const w=innerWidth,h=innerHeight; const pr=resMult*adaptiveResFactor;\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(pr); renderer.setSize(w,h); mat.uniforms.uRes.value.set(w*pr,h*pr); }"},{"t":76,"type":"agent_completed","agent_type":"coder","agent_index":0,"tokens":5400,"cost":0.27},{"t":78,"type":"camera_focus","target":"finalizer_0"},{"t":78,"type":"phase_started","phase":"finalizing"},{"t":78.2,"type":"agent_started","agent_type":"finalizer"},{"t":84,"type":"agent_completed","agent_type":"finalizer","tokens":2100,"cost":0.13},{"t":85,"type":"camera_focus","target":"output"},{"t":88,"type":"workflow_completed"}],"annotations":[],"narration_chapters":[{"id":"specification","t_start":0.5,"icon":"📜","title":"Specification — your conversation with CodeForge","paragraphs":["You're watching a replay of a real CodeForge session at 60× speed — no live LLM calls. The agents below actually built this.","The ask: a real-time WebGL visualisation of a quaternion Julia strange attractor (z → z² + c with z, c ∈ ℍ), ray-marched with a distance estimator, colour-temperature lights, palettes and an animated reveal.","Press ▶ Continue to assemble the team and start coding."],"closing_paragraph":"Spec parsed. Spinning up the team."},{"id":"coding-1","t_start":12,"icon":"👨‍💻","title":"Coding — ray-marching the fractal","paragraphs":["The Coder writes a single self-contained HTML file: a GLSL distance estimator for the quaternion Julia set, sphere-traced per pixel, with normal-based lighting, soft shadows and AO.","Watch the code stream live on the Coder node. It also self-tests in a headless browser before handing off."],"closing_paragraph":"First version renders the attractor — but the resolution handling has a flaw."},{"id":"testing-1","t_start":34,"icon":"🔍","title":"Testing — auditing correctness & resolution","paragraphs":["Two Testers (different model families) run the code and review it: is the attractor geometrically correct? Does it hold 60 fps? Is the resolution scaling right?","They flag it: the “Разрешение 2.0x” slider multiplies on top of devicePixelRatio — so 2× becomes 4× on a retina screen, with no upper bound — the ray-marcher stalls and the adaptive system silently downscales."],"closing_paragraph":"Tester 1: 1 serious (resolution) + notes. Tester 2: 2 minor."},{"id":"summarizer","t_start":52,"icon":"📊","title":"Summarizer — one prioritised brief","paragraphs":["The Summarizer merges both audits into a single ranked brief for the next iteration: fix the resolution double-counting first."],"closing_paragraph":"Brief ready: make the resolution multiplier absolute and bounded."},{"id":"coding-2","t_start":60,"icon":"🔧","title":"Iteration 2 — fixing the resolution","paragraphs":["The Coder rewrites updateRes(): resMult is now the absolute supersample factor (no × devicePixelRatio), so “2.0x” honestly means 2× and the drawing buffer stays bounded. Adaptive quality stays as the safety net.","Same attractor maths — just an honest, bounded resolution control."],"closing_paragraph":"Resolution fixed; the attractor renders crisp and stable."},{"id":"run","t_start":86,"icon":"🎉","title":"Final attractor — try it","cta_label":"Replay from start","secondary_cta":{"label":"▶ Run attractor","action":"run_final"},"paragraphs":["Here's the finished quaternion-Julia attractor with the resolution fix and the exact look from the screenshot: Inferno palette, Ultra quality, 2.0× resolution, FOV 86°, 40 iterations, key light at 6100 K.","Click Run attractor to interact — orbit the camera, switch palettes and lights, scrub the animation. Or open it in a full separate window from the Final result tab.","Want your own? Hit Try it yourself and CodeForge runs this pipeline live on whatever you ask for."]}],"final_code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ru\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Кватернионный Фрактал Жюлиа — Странный Аттрактор 3D</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{background:#000;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:#ddd}\ncanvas{display:block;width:100vw;height:100vh}\n#ui{position:fixed;top:8px;right:8px;width:260px;background:rgba(8,8,18,0.93);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);max-height:96vh;overflow-y:auto;z-index:10;font-size:11px}\n#ui::-webkit-scrollbar{width:4px}#ui::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#444;border-radius:2px}\n#ui h3{font-size:10px;margin:6px 0 3px;color:#8af;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}\n#ui label{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:#999;font-size:10px}\n#ui input[type=range]{width:100%;margin:1px 0;accent-color:#6af;height:14px}\n#ui select{width:100%;padding:3px;background:#1a1a2e;color:#ddd;border:1px solid #444;border-radius:3px;font-size:10px}\n#ui button{padding:3px 7px;margin:2px;background:#2a2a4e;color:#aaf;border:1px solid #445;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;font-size:10px}\n#ui button:hover{background:#3a3a6e}\n#ui button.active{background:#4a4a8e;border-color:#88f}\n.row{display:flex;gap:2px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:3px}\n.sep{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);margin:6px 0}\n#timer{position:fixed;bottom:12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);z-index:10;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)}\n#phase{position:fixed;bottom:36px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:12px;color:rgba(140,170,255,0.6);z-index:10;text-align:center;text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);transition:opacity 0.5s}\n#info{position:fixed;top:8px;left:8px;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);z-index:10;line-height:1.5;max-width:280px}\n#fpsDisp{position:fixed;bottom:12px;right:12px;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);z-index:10}\n#errMsg{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:#111;color:#f66;font-size:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:100;text-align:center;padding:40px;flex-direction:column}\n#mathDesc{position:fixed;top:8px;left:8px;font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);z-index:10;line-height:1.6;max-width:300px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);padding:8px;border-radius:6px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"errMsg\">\n  <div>Требуется WebGL 2</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:14px;margin-top:12px;color:#999\">Используйте современный браузер (Chrome, Firefox, Edge)</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"mathDesc\">\n  <b style=\"color:#8af\">Странный аттрактор Жюлиа (кватернионы)</b><br>\n  z → z² + c, где z,c ∈ ℍ (кватернионы)<br>\n  c = (-0.2, 0.6, 0.2, 0.0)<br>\n  <span id=\"phaseDesc\" style=\"color:#6d8\">Инициализация...</span>\n</div>\n<div id=\"timer\">t = 0.00s</div>\n<div id=\"phase\"></div>\n<div id=\"fpsDisp\">FPS: --</div>\n<div id=\"ui\">\n  <h3>🌀 Палитра</h3>\n  <div class=\"row\" id=\"palRow\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"sep\"></div>\n  <h3>⏱ Анимация</h3>\n  <label>Время: <span id=\"tVal\">0.00</span>с / 20</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"timeSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <button id=\"playBtn\">▶ Старт</button>\n    <button id=\"pauseBtn\">⏸ Пауза</button>\n    <button id=\"resetBtn\">⟲ Сброс</button>\n  </div>\n  <label>Скорость: <span id=\"speedVal\">2.0</span>x</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"speedSlider\" min=\"0.1\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2\">\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"showParticles\"> Орбиты частиц</label>\n\n  <div class=\"sep\"></div>\n  <h3>💡 Освещение</h3>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <button class=\"light-sel active\" data-idx=\"0\">Ключ</button>\n    <button class=\"light-sel\" data-idx=\"1\">Заполн.</button>\n    <button class=\"light-sel\" data-idx=\"2\">Контр.</button>\n  </div>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"lEnabled\" checked> Включён</label>\n  <label>Температура: <span id=\"lTempV\">5500</span>K</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"lTemp\" min=\"2000\" max=\"10000\" step=\"100\" value=\"5500\">\n  <label>Мягкость: <span id=\"lSoftV\">0.5</span></label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"lSoft\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.5\">\n  <label>Интенсивность: <span id=\"lIntV\">1.20</span></label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"lInt\" min=\"0\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1.2\">\n  <label>Высота: <span id=\"lElV\">45</span>°</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"lEl\" min=\"-90\" max=\"90\" step=\"1\" value=\"45\">\n  <label>Азимут: <span id=\"lAzV\">45</span>°</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"lAz\" min=\"0\" max=\"360\" step=\"1\" value=\"45\">\n\n  <div class=\"sep\"></div>\n  <h3>🎥 Камера и качество</h3>\n  <label>Качество</label>\n  <select id=\"qualityPreset\">\n    <option value=\"0\">Низкое (быстро)</option>\n    <option value=\"1\">Среднее</option>\n    <option value=\"2\">Высокое</option>\n    <option value=\"3\" selected>Ультра</option>\n  </select>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"adaptiveQ\" checked> Адаптивное качество</label>\n  <label>Разрешение: <span id=\"resVal\">2.00</span>x</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"resSlider\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"2\">\n  <label>FOV: <span id=\"fovVal\">86</span>°</label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"fovSlider\" min=\"20\" max=\"120\" step=\"1\" value=\"86\">\n  <label>Итерации: <span id=\"iterVal\">40</span></label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"iterSlider\" min=\"3\" max=\"40\" step=\"1\" value=\"40\">\n  <label>AO: <span id=\"aoVal\">0.0</span></label>\n  <input type=\"range\" id=\"aoSlider\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\">\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  try {\n    const tc = document.createElement('canvas');\n    const gl = tc.getContext('webgl2');\n    if (!gl) throw 0;\n  } catch(e) {\n    document.getElementById('errMsg').style.display = 'flex';\n    return;\n  }\n  startApp();\n})();\n\nfunction startApp() {\n\nlet loadAttempts = 0;\nconst urls = [\n  'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/build/three.min.js',\n  'https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.min.js'\n];\n\nfunction loadScript(cb) {\n  if (loadAttempts >= urls.length) {\n    const e = document.getElementById('errMsg');\n    e.querySelector('div').textContent = 'Не удалось загрузить Three.js';\n    e.style.display = 'flex';\n    return;\n  }\n  const s = document.createElement('script');\n  s.src = urls[loadAttempts++];\n  s.onload = cb;\n  s.onerror = () => loadScript(cb);\n  document.head.appendChild(s);\n}\n\nloadScript(init);\n\nfunction init() {\n\n// ============ Palettes ============\nconst palettes = [\n  {name:\"Инферно\",  c:[\"#000004\",\"#420a68\",\"#932667\",\"#dd513a\",\"#fca50a\",\"#fcffa4\"]},\n  {name:\"Океан\",    c:[\"#000428\",\"#004e92\",\"#007991\",\"#00b4d8\",\"#90e0ef\",\"#caf0f8\"]},\n  {name:\"Изумруд\",  c:[\"#0a0a0a\",\"#003300\",\"#006600\",\"#00cc44\",\"#66ff99\",\"#eeffee\"]},\n  {name:\"Аметист\",  c:[\"#0d0015\",\"#2d004f\",\"#6a0dad\",\"#b44ac0\",\"#e879f9\",\"#fae8ff\"]},\n  {name:\"Магма\",    c:[\"#000000\",\"#51127c\",\"#b73779\",\"#fc8961\",\"#fcfdbf\",\"#ffffff\"]},\n  {name:\"Лёд\",      c:[\"#000033\",\"#003366\",\"#336699\",\"#6699cc\",\"#99ccff\",\"#ccffff\"]},\n  {name:\"Закат\",    c:[\"#1a0000\",\"#660000\",\"#cc3300\",\"#ff6600\",\"#ffcc00\",\"#ffffcc\"]},\n  {name:\"Кибер\",    c:[\"#0a0a1a\",\"#1a0033\",\"#ff00ff\",\"#00ffff\",\"#ffff00\",\"#ffffff\"]},\n];\nlet curPal = 0;\n\nconst palRow = document.getElementById('palRow');\npalettes.forEach((p,i) => {\n  const b = document.createElement('button');\n  b.textContent = p.name;\n  if(i===0) b.className='active';\n  b.onclick = () => { curPal=i; palRow.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(x=>x.className=''); b.className='active'; syncPalette(); };\n  palRow.appendChild(b);\n});\n\n// ============ Lights State - now with temperature & softness ============\nconst lts = [\n  {on:true, temp:6100, soft:0.55, int:2.90, el:29, az:328},\n  {on:true, temp:3500, soft:0.8, int:0.5, el:-15, az:210},\n  {on:true, temp:8000, soft:0.3, int:0.35, el:5, az:310},\n];\nlet selL = 0;\n\n// Color temperature to RGB (simplified Planckian)\nfunction tempToRGB(K) {\n  K = Math.max(1000, Math.min(15000, K));\n  let r, g, b;\n  const t = K / 100;\n  if (t <= 66) { r = 255; } else { r = 329.698727446 * Math.pow(t - 60, -0.1332047592); }\n  if (t <= 66) { g = 99.4708025861 * Math.log(t) - 161.1195681661; } else { g = 288.1221695283 * Math.pow(t - 60, -0.0755148492); }\n  if (t >= 66) { b = 255; } else if (t <= 19) { b = 0; } else { b = 138.5177312231 * Math.log(t - 10) - 305.0447927307; }\n  return [Math.max(0,Math.min(255,r))/255, Math.max(0,Math.min(255,g))/255, Math.max(0,Math.min(255,b))/255];\n}\n\nfunction lDir(el,az){\n  const er=el*Math.PI/180, ar=az*Math.PI/180;\n  return new THREE.Vector3(Math.cos(er)*Math.cos(ar), Math.sin(er), Math.cos(er)*Math.sin(ar)).normalize();\n}\n\n// ============ Quality ============\nconst qualityPresets = [\n  {iter:8, marchSteps:100, shadowSteps:12, aoSteps:3, particles:40000},\n  {iter:12, marchSteps:160, shadowSteps:20, aoSteps:4, particles:80000},\n  {iter:16, marchSteps:220, shadowSteps:28, aoSteps:5, particles:140000},\n  {iter:24, marchSteps:320, shadowSteps:40, aoSteps:5, particles:200000},\n];\nlet curQuality = 3;\nlet resMult = 2.0;\nlet adaptiveQuality = true;\nlet adaptiveResFactor = 1.0;\n\n// ============ Three.js Setup ============\nconst renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:false, powerPreference:'high-performance', alpha:true});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\nrenderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\nrenderer.autoClear = false;\ndocument.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\nconst fractalScene = new THREE.Scene();\nconst orthoCam = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1,1,1,-1,0,1);\nconst particleScene = new THREE.Scene();\nconst perspCam = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth/window.innerHeight, 0.01, 100);\n\n// ============ Fractal Shader ============\nconst rawVS = `\nin vec3 position;\nin vec2 uv;\nout vec2 vUv;\nvoid main(){vUv=uv;gl_Position=vec4(position.xy,0.,1.);}`;\n\nconst rawFS = `\nprecision highp float;\nin vec2 vUv;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nuniform vec2 uRes;\nuniform float uFOV, uReveal, uAO, uDetailFade, uGlow;\nuniform int uMaxIter, uMarchSteps, uShadowSteps;\nuniform vec3 uCamPos, uCamTgt;\nuniform vec3 uLD[3], uLC[3];\nuniform float uLI[3], uLS[3], uLK[3];\nuniform vec4 uJC;\nuniform vec3 uPC[6];\n\nvec4 qSq(vec4 q){return vec4(q.x*q.x-q.y*q.y-q.z*q.z-q.w*q.w,2.*q.x*q.y,2.*q.x*q.z,2.*q.x*q.w);}\n\nfloat juliaDE(vec3 p, out float trap){\n  vec4 z=vec4(p,0.), dz=vec4(1.,0.,0.,0.);\n  float r; trap=1e10;\n  for(int i=0;i<64;i++){\n    if(i>=uMaxIter) break;\n    r=length(z); if(r>4.) break;\n    trap=min(trap,length(z.xyz));\n    trap=min(trap,abs(z.x)+abs(z.y)*.5);\n    trap=min(trap,length(z.yz));\n    dz=2.*vec4(\n      z.x*dz.x-z.y*dz.y-z.z*dz.z-z.w*dz.w,\n      z.x*dz.y+z.y*dz.x+z.z*dz.w-z.w*dz.z,\n      z.x*dz.z-z.y*dz.w+z.z*dz.x+z.w*dz.y,\n      z.x*dz.w+z.y*dz.z-z.z*dz.y+z.w*dz.x\n    );\n    z=qSq(z)+uJC;\n  }\n  r=length(z); float dr=length(dz);\n  return dr>0.?0.5*r*log(r)/dr:0.;\n}\n\nfloat mapDE(vec3 p, out float trap){return juliaDE(p,trap);}\n\nvec3 calcN(vec3 p){float t;float h=.0003;vec2 e=vec2(h,0.);\n  return normalize(vec3(mapDE(p+e.xyy,t)-mapDE(p-e.xyy,t),mapDE(p+e.yxy,t)-mapDE(p-e.yxy,t),mapDE(p+e.yyx,t)-mapDE(p-e.yyx,t)));}\n\nfloat calcAO(vec3 p,vec3 n){float o=0.,w=1.,t;\n  for(int i=0;i<5;i++){float h=.01+.06*float(i);o+=(h-mapDE(p+h*n,t))*w;w*=.65;}\n  return clamp(1.-uAO*2.*o,0.,1.);}\n\nfloat shadow(vec3 ro,vec3 rd,float mn,float mx,float k){\n  float res=1.,t=mn,tr;\n  for(int i=0;i<64;i++){\n    if(i>=uShadowSteps) break;\n    float h=mapDE(ro+rd*t,tr);\n    if(h<.0002)return .05;\n    res=min(res,k*h/t);\n    t+=clamp(h,.002,.15);\n    if(t>mx)break;\n  }\n  return clamp(res,.05,1.);}\n\nvec3 palCol(float t){t=clamp(t,0.,1.)*4.;int i=int(floor(t));float f=fract(t);\n  if(i>=5){i=4;f=1.;}return mix(uPC[i],uPC[i+1],smoothstep(0.,1.,f));}\n\nmat3 lookAt(vec3 e,vec3 t,vec3 u){vec3 f=normalize(t-e),r=normalize(cross(f,u)),uu=cross(r,f);return mat3(r,uu,f);}\n\nvoid main(){\n  vec2 fc=vUv*uRes, uv=(fc-.5*uRes)/uRes.y;\n  float fl=1./tan(uFOV*3.14159265/360.);\n  mat3 cam=lookAt(uCamPos,uCamTgt,vec3(0,1,0));\n  vec3 rd=cam*normalize(vec3(uv,fl)), ro=uCamPos;\n  \n  float revR=uReveal*2.5;\n  float t=0., trap=0.; bool hit=false;\n  \n  for(int i=0;i<512;i++){\n    if(i>=uMarchSteps) break;\n    vec3 p=ro+rd*t;\n    float d=mapDE(p,trap);\n    float dc=length(p)-revR;\n    d=max(d,dc);\n    if(d<.0002){hit=true;break;}\n    if(t>10.)break;\n    t+=d*.7;\n  }\n  \n  if(hit){\n    vec3 p=ro+rd*t;\n    if(length(p)>revR+.01) hit=false;\n  }\n  \n  if(hit){\n    vec3 p=ro+rd*t, n=calcN(p);\n    float tn=clamp(trap*.6,0.,1.);\n    vec3 mc=palCol(tn);\n    float ao=calcAO(p,n);\n    \n    vec3 col=mc*.04;\n    \n    for(int li=0;li<3;li++){\n      if(uLI[li]<=0.)continue;\n      float diff=max(dot(n,uLD[li]),0.);\n      vec3 h=normalize(uLD[li]-rd);\n      float spec=pow(max(dot(n,h),0.),uLS[li]);\n      float sha=shadow(p+n*.003,uLD[li],.01,4.,uLK[li]);\n      col+=mc*diff*uLC[li]*uLI[li]*sha;\n      col+=spec*uLC[li]*uLI[li]*sha*.35;\n    }\n    \n    float rim=pow(1.-max(dot(n,-rd),0.),3.)*.2;\n    col+=rim*vec3(.5,.6,.8);\n    float sss=pow(clamp(dot(rd,-n),0.,1.),2.)*.08;\n    col+=mc*sss;\n    col*=ao;\n    \n    // Detail fade-in\n    col*=uDetailFade;\n    \n    float fog=exp(-t*.12);\n    col=mix(vec3(.01,.01,.02),col,fog);\n    \n    // Reveal edge glow\n    float ed=abs(length(p)-revR);\n    if(ed<.15&&uReveal<.98) col+=vec3(.15,.3,.9)*exp(-ed*25.)*(1.-uReveal)*uGlow;\n    \n    // Tonemapping ACES\n    col=col*(2.51*col+.03)/(col*(2.43*col+.59)+.14);\n    col=pow(col,vec3(.4545));\n    vec2 v=vUv-.5; col*=1.-.3*dot(v,v);\n    fragColor=vec4(col,1.);\n  } else {\n    fragColor=vec4(0.,0.,0.,0.);\n  }\n}`;\n\nfunction hex3(h){return new THREE.Vector3(parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255);}\n\nconst mat = new THREE.RawShaderMaterial({\n  glslVersion: THREE.GLSL3,\n  vertexShader: rawVS,\n  fragmentShader: rawFS,\n  depthWrite: false,\n  depthTest: false,\n  transparent: true,\n  uniforms:{\n    uRes:{value:new THREE.Vector2()},\n    uFOV:{value:86}, uMaxIter:{value:40}, uReveal:{value:0}, uAO:{value:0},\n    uDetailFade:{value:0}, uGlow:{value:1},\n    uMarchSteps:{value:320}, uShadowSteps:{value:40},\n    uCamPos:{value:new THREE.Vector3(0,0,2.5)}, uCamTgt:{value:new THREE.Vector3(0,0,0)},\n    uLD:{value:[new THREE.Vector3(),new THREE.Vector3(),new THREE.Vector3()]},\n    uLC:{value:[new THREE.Vector3(),new THREE.Vector3(),new THREE.Vector3()]},\n    uLI:{value:[0,0,0]}, uLS:{value:[32,32,32]}, uLK:{value:[8,8,8]},\n    uJC:{value:new THREE.Vector4(-0.2, 0.6, 0.2, 0.0)},\n    uPC:{value:palettes[0].c.map(hex3)},\n  }\n});\n\nfractalScene.add(new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2,2), mat));\n\nfunction syncPalette(){mat.uniforms.uPC.value=palettes[curPal].c.map(hex3);}\n\nfunction syncLights(){\n  for(let i=0;i<3;i++){\n    const L=lts[i], d=lDir(L.el,L.az);\n    const rgb = tempToRGB(L.temp);\n    // Softness affects specular power and shadow sharpness\n    const specPow = 8 + (1-L.soft)*120; // soft=1 -> 8, soft=0 -> 128\n    const shadowK = 2 + (1-L.soft)*30;  // soft=1 -> 2 (very soft), soft=0 -> 32 (sharp)\n    mat.uniforms.uLD.value[i].copy(d);\n    mat.uniforms.uLC.value[i].set(rgb[0],rgb[1],rgb[2]);\n    mat.uniforms.uLI.value[i]=L.on?L.int:0;\n    mat.uniforms.uLS.value[i]=specPow;\n    mat.uniforms.uLK.value[i]=shadowK;\n  }\n}\nsyncLights();\n\nfunction updateRes(){\n  const w = window.innerWidth, h = window.innerHeight;\n  // RES-FIX: resMult is the absolute supersample factor (no DPR double-count);\n  // bounded by the slider max (2.0) so the buffer never exceeds 2x the window.\n  const pr = resMult * adaptiveResFactor;\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(pr);\n  renderer.setSize(w, h);\n  mat.uniforms.uRes.value.set(w*pr, h*pr);\n}\nupdateRes();\n\n// ============ Background scene ============\nconst bgScene = new THREE.Scene();\nconst bgVS = `\nvarying vec2 vUv;\nvoid main(){vUv=uv;gl_Position=vec4(position.xy,0.,1.);}`;\nconst bgFS = `\nvarying vec2 vUv;\nvoid main(){\n  vec3 c=mix(vec3(0.008,0.008,0.025),vec3(0.02,0.015,0.05),vUv.y);\n  // Stars\n  float h=fract(sin(dot(floor(vUv*800.),vec2(127.1,311.7)))*43758.5453);\n  if(h>0.998) c+=vec3(0.3)*smoothstep(0.998,1.0,h);\n  gl_FragColor=vec4(c,1.);\n}`;\nconst bgMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({vertexShader:bgVS,fragmentShader:bgFS,depthWrite:false,depthTest:false});\nbgScene.add(new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2,2), bgMat));\n\n// ============ Particle System ============\nconst MAX_P = 300000;\nconst pPos = new Float32Array(MAX_P*3);\nconst pCol = new Float32Array(MAX_P*3);\nconst pAlp = new Float32Array(MAX_P);\nlet totalParticles = 0;\nlet needParticleRegen = false;\n\nconst pGeom = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\npGeom.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(pPos,3));\npGeom.setAttribute('aCol', new THREE.BufferAttribute(pCol,3));\npGeom.setAttribute('aAlp', new THREE.BufferAttribute(pAlp,1));\npGeom.setDrawRange(0,0);\n\nconst ptVS=`\nattribute vec3 aCol;\nattribute float aAlp;\nvarying vec3 vCol;\nvarying float vAlp;\nvoid main(){\n  vCol=aCol; vAlp=aAlp;\n  vec4 mv=modelViewMatrix*vec4(position,1.);\n  gl_PointSize=max(1.,3.*aAlp*(200./-mv.z));\n  gl_Position=projectionMatrix*mv;\n}`;\nconst ptFS=`\nvarying vec3 vCol;\nvarying float vAlp;\nvoid main(){\n  if(vAlp<.01)discard;\n  float d=length(gl_PointCoord-.5);\n  if(d>.5)discard;\n  float a=vAlp*smoothstep(.5,.05,d);\n  gl_FragColor=vec4(vCol*1.8,a);\n}`;\n\nconst ptMat = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n  vertexShader:ptVS, fragmentShader:ptFS,\n  transparent:true, blending:THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n  depthWrite:false, depthTest:false\n});\nparticleScene.add(new THREE.Points(pGeom, ptMat));\n\nlet showParts = false;\n\nfunction getPalRGB(){\n  return palettes[curPal].c.map(h=>({\n    r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,\n    g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,\n    b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255\n  }));\n}\n\n// The Julia constant - FIXED for proper attractor demonstration\nconst JULIA_C = {x:-0.2, y:0.6, z:0.2, w:0.0};\n\nfunction accumulateParticles(time, dt){\n  if(!showParts || time < 0.3) { pGeom.setDrawRange(0,0); return; }\n  \n  const maxP = qualityPresets[curQuality].particles;\n  // Time-dependent batch size\n  const batchSize = Math.min(1200, Math.floor((80 + time * 60) * Math.min(dt*60, 2)));\n  const maxIter = Math.min(30, 4 + Math.floor(time * 1.3));\n  const pal = getPalRGB();\n  \n  if(needParticleRegen){\n    totalParticles=0;\n    needParticleRegen=false;\n  }\n  \n  // Fade old particles slightly\n  if(totalParticles > maxP * 0.9){\n    for(let i=0; i<totalParticles; i++) pAlp[i] *= 0.995;\n    // Compact\n    let write=0;\n    for(let i=0;i<totalParticles;i++){\n      if(pAlp[i]>0.01){\n        if(write!==i){\n          const i3=i*3, w3=write*3;\n          pPos[w3]=pPos[i3]; pPos[w3+1]=pPos[i3+1]; pPos[w3+2]=pPos[i3+2];\n          pCol[w3]=pCol[i3]; pCol[w3+1]=pCol[i3+1]; pCol[w3+2]=pCol[i3+2];\n          pAlp[write]=pAlp[i];\n        }\n        write++;\n      }\n    }\n    totalParticles=write;\n  }\n  \n  let cnt = totalParticles;\n  const revR = Math.min(1, time/8) * 2.5;\n  const jc = JULIA_C;\n  \n  for(let s=0; s<batchSize && cnt<Math.min(maxP, MAX_P); s++){\n    // Random starting point on a sphere\n    const rad = 1.5 * Math.cbrt(Math.random());\n    const th = Math.random()*Math.PI*2;\n    const ph = Math.acos(2*Math.random()-1);\n    let zx=rad*Math.sin(ph)*Math.cos(th);\n    let zy=rad*Math.sin(ph)*Math.sin(th);\n    let zz=rad*Math.cos(ph);\n    let zw=0;\n    \n    for(let i=0; i<maxIter; i++){\n      const nx=zx*zx-zy*zy-zz*zz-zw*zw+jc.x;\n      const ny=2*zx*zy+jc.y;\n      const nz=2*zx*zz+jc.z;\n      const nw=2*zx*zw+jc.w;\n      zx=nx; zy=ny; zz=nz; zw=nw;\n      const r2=zx*zx+zy*zy+zz*zz+zw*zw;\n      if(r2>4) break;\n      \n      const pr = Math.sqrt(zx*zx+zy*zy+zz*zz);\n      if(pr > revR) continue;\n      if(i < 2) continue; // skip early iterations for cleaner orbits\n      \n      if(cnt < Math.min(maxP, MAX_P)){\n        const p3=cnt*3;\n        pPos[p3]=zx; pPos[p3+1]=zy; pPos[p3+2]=zz;\n        const t=i/maxIter;\n        const pi=Math.min(4,Math.floor(t*5));\n        const pf=t*5-pi;\n        const c0=pal[pi], c1=pal[Math.min(5,pi+1)];\n        pCol[p3]=c0.r+(c1.r-c0.r)*pf;\n        pCol[p3+1]=c0.g+(c1.g-c0.g)*pf;\n        pCol[p3+2]=c0.b+(c1.b-c0.b)*pf;\n        const alphaBase = 0.15 + 0.25 * (1-i/maxIter);\n        pAlp[cnt] = alphaBase * Math.min(1, time/4);\n        cnt++;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  \n  totalParticles = cnt;\n  pGeom.attributes.position.needsUpdate=true;\n  pGeom.attributes.aCol.needsUpdate=true;\n  pGeom.attributes.aAlp.needsUpdate=true;\n  pGeom.setDrawRange(0, totalParticles);\n}\n\n// ============ Camera Orbit ============\nlet camTh=0.3, camPh=0.4, camD=2.8, dragging=false, lm={x:0,y:0};\nlet pinchDist = 0;\nconst cvs=renderer.domElement;\n\ncvs.addEventListener('mousedown',e=>{dragging=true;lm={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY};});\ndocument.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{\n  if(!dragging)return;\n  camTh-=(e.clientX-lm.x)*.005;\n  camPh=Math.max(-1.4,Math.min(1.4,camPh+(e.clientY-lm.y)*.005));\n  lm={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY};\n});\ndocument.addEventListener('mouseup',()=>dragging=false);\ncvs.addEventListener('wheel',e=>{camD=Math.max(.5,Math.min(6,camD+e.deltaY*.002));e.preventDefault();},{passive:false});\n\ncvs.addEventListener('touchstart',e=>{\n  if(e.touches.length===1){dragging=true;lm={x:e.touches[0].clientX,y:e.touches[0].clientY};}\n  else if(e.touches.length===2){const dx=e.touches[0].clientX-e.touches[1].clientX;const dy=e.touches[0].clientY-e.touches[1].clientY;pinchDist=Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy);}\n},{passive:true});\ncvs.addEventListener('touchmove',e=>{\n  if(e.touches.length===1&&dragging){camTh-=(e.touches[0].clientX-lm.x)*.005;camPh=Math.max(-1.4,Math.min(1.4,camPh+(e.touches[0].clientY-lm.y)*.005));lm={x:e.touches[0].clientX,y:e.touches[0].clientY};}\n  else if(e.touches.length===2){const dx=e.touches[0].clientX-e.touches[1].clientX;const dy=e.touches[0].clientY-e.touches[1].clientY;const d=Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy);if(pinchDist>0)camD=Math.max(.5,Math.min(6,camD*(pinchDist/d)));pinchDist=d;}\n  e.preventDefault();\n},{passive:false});\ncvs.addEventListener('touchend',e=>{if(e.touches.length<2)pinchDist=0;if(e.touches.length===0)dragging=false;});\n\n// ============ Animation Phases ============\n// Phase 1 (0-4s): Birth - reveal sphere grows, low detail, orbits begin\n// Phase 2 (4-10s): Growth - detail increases, more orbits, lighting builds\n// Phase 3 (10-16s): Refinement - full detail, rich shadows, AO\n// Phase 4 (16-20s): Glory - camera slow sweep, maximum beauty\n\nconst phaseDescs = [\n  \"Фаза 1: Рождение — сфера раскрытия расширяется\",\n  \"Фаза 2: Рост — детализация нарастает\",\n  \"Фаза 3: Формирование — тени и рельеф\",\n  \"Фаза 4: Аттрактор — полная структура\",\n];\n\nfunction getPhaseParams(t) {\n  if (t < 4) {\n    // Birth\n    const p = t / 4;\n    return {\n      reveal: p * 0.4,\n      detailFade: 0.3 + p * 0.3,\n      glow: 1.0,\n      iterMul: 0.5 + p * 0.2,\n      phase: 0,\n      camDOffset: 0.5 * (1 - p)\n    };\n  } else if (t < 10) {\n    const p = (t - 4) / 6;\n    return {\n      reveal: 0.4 + p * 0.4,\n      detailFade: 0.6 + p * 0.3,\n      glow: 0.8,\n      iterMul: 0.7 + p * 0.2,\n      phase: 1,\n      camDOffset: 0\n    };\n  } else if (t < 16) {\n    const p = (t - 10) / 6;\n    return {\n      reveal: 0.8 + p * 0.15,\n      detailFade: 0.9 + p * 0.1,\n      glow: 0.5 * (1 - p),\n      iterMul: 0.9 + p * 0.1,\n      phase: 2,\n      camDOffset: -0.2 * p\n    };\n  } else {\n    const p = (t - 16) / 4;\n    return {\n      reveal: 0.95 + p * 0.05,\n      detailFade: 1.0,\n      glow: 0,\n      iterMul: 1.0,\n      phase: 3,\n      camDOffset: -0.2 + 0.05 * Math.sin(p * Math.PI)\n    };\n  }\n}\n\n// ============ Animation State ============\nlet animT=0, playing=true, speed=2, lastT=performance.now();\n\n// Adaptive quality tracking\nlet fpsFrames=0, fpsTime=0, currentFPS=60;\nlet fpsHistory = [];\nconst fpsEl = document.getElementById('fpsDisp');\n\n// ============ UI Bindings ============\nconst tSlider=document.getElementById('timeSlider');\nconst tValEl=document.getElementById('tVal');\nconst timerEl=document.getElementById('timer');\nconst phaseEl=document.getElementById('phase');\nconst phaseDescEl=document.getElementById('phaseDesc');\n\ndocument.getElementById('playBtn').onclick=()=>{playing=true;lastT=performance.now();};\ndocument.getElementById('pauseBtn').onclick=()=>playing=false;\ndocument.getElementById('resetBtn').onclick=()=>{animT=0;playing=true;lastT=performance.now();totalParticles=0;needParticleRegen=true;};\ntSlider.oninput=()=>{animT=parseFloat(tSlider.value);lastT=performance.now();needParticleRegen=true;};\ndocument.getElementById('speedSlider').oninput=function(){speed=parseFloat(this.value);document.getElementById('speedVal').textContent=speed.toFixed(1);};\ndocument.getElementById('showParticles').onchange=function(){showParts=this.checked;if(!this.checked)pGeom.setDrawRange(0,0);};\n\ndocument.getElementById('qualityPreset').onchange=function(){\n  curQuality=parseInt(this.value);\n  const q=qualityPresets[curQuality];\n  mat.uniforms.uMaxIter.value=q.iter;\n  mat.uniforms.uMarchSteps.value=q.marchSteps;\n  mat.uniforms.uShadowSteps.value=q.shadowSteps;\n  document.getElementById('iterSlider').value=q.iter;\n  document.getElementById('iterVal').textContent=q.iter;\n  needParticleRegen=true;\n};\n\ndocument.getElementById('adaptiveQ').onchange=function(){adaptiveQuality=this.checked; if(!this.checked){adaptiveResFactor=1;updateRes();}};\n\ndocument.getElementById('resSlider').oninput=function(){\n  resMult=parseFloat(this.value);\n  document.getElementById('resVal').textContent=resMult.toFixed(2);\n  updateRes();\n};\n\n// Light UI\nfunction syncLightUI(){\n  const L=lts[selL];\n  document.getElementById('lEnabled').checked=L.on;\n  document.getElementById('lTemp').value=L.temp;\n  document.getElementById('lTempV').textContent=L.temp;\n  document.getElementById('lSoft').value=L.soft;\n  document.getElementById('lSoftV').textContent=L.soft.toFixed(2);\n  document.getElementById('lInt').value=L.int;\n  document.getElementById('lIntV').textContent=L.int.toFixed(2);\n  document.getElementById('lEl').value=L.el;\n  document.getElementById('lElV').textContent=L.el;\n  document.getElementById('lAz').value=L.az;\n  document.getElementById('lAzV').textContent=L.az;\n}\nsyncLightUI();\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.light-sel').forEach(b=>{\n  b.onclick=()=>{\n    selL=parseInt(b.dataset.idx);\n    document.querySelectorAll('.light-sel').forEach(x=>x.className='light-sel');\n    b.className='light-sel active';\n    syncLightUI();\n  };\n});\ndocument.getElementById('lEnabled').onchange=function(){lts[selL].on=this.checked;syncLights();};\ndocument.getElementById('lTemp').oninput=function(){lts[selL].temp=parseInt(this.value);document.getElementById('lTempV').textContent=this.value;syncLights();};\ndocument.getElementById('lSoft').oninput=function(){lts[selL].soft=parseFloat(this.value);document.getElementById('lSoftV').textContent=parseFloat(this.value).toFixed(2);syncLights();};\ndocument.getElementById('lInt').oninput=function(){lts[selL].int=parseFloat(this.value);document.getElementById('lIntV').textContent=parseFloat(this.value).toFixed(2);syncLights();};\ndocument.getElementById('lEl').oninput=function(){lts[selL].el=parseInt(this.value);document.getElementById('lElV').textContent=this.value;syncLights();};\ndocument.getElementById('lAz').oninput=function(){lts[selL].az=parseInt(this.value);document.getElementById('lAzV').textContent=this.value;syncLights();};\n\ndocument.getElementById('fovSlider').oninput=function(){mat.uniforms.uFOV.value=parseFloat(this.value);document.getElementById('fovVal').textContent=this.value;};\ndocument.getElementById('iterSlider').oninput=function(){mat.uniforms.uMaxIter.value=parseInt(this.value);document.getElementById('iterVal').textContent=this.value;};\ndocument.getElementById('aoSlider').oninput=function(){mat.uniforms.uAO.value=parseFloat(this.value);document.getElementById('aoVal').textContent=parseFloat(this.value).toFixed(1);};\n\n// ============ Adaptive Quality ============\nfunction adaptQuality() {\n  if (!adaptiveQuality) return;\n  fpsHistory.push(currentFPS);\n  if (fpsHistory.length > 5) fpsHistory.shift();\n  const avg = fpsHistory.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0) / fpsHistory.length;\n  \n  if (avg < 20 && adaptiveResFactor > 0.4) {\n    adaptiveResFactor = Math.max(0.4, adaptiveResFactor - 0.1);\n    updateRes();\n  } else if (avg < 30 && adaptiveResFactor > 0.5) {\n    adaptiveResFactor = Math.max(0.5, adaptiveResFactor - 0.05);\n    updateRes();\n  } else if (avg > 50 && adaptiveResFactor < 1.0) {\n    adaptiveResFactor = Math.min(1.0, adaptiveResFactor + 0.02);\n    updateRes();\n  }\n}\n\n// ============ Render Loop ============\nlet lastPhase = -1;\n\nfunction animate(){\n  requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n  const now=performance.now();\n  const dt=Math.min(.1,(now-lastT)/1000);\n  lastT=now;\n  \n  fpsFrames++;\n  fpsTime+=dt;\n  if(fpsTime>=1.0){\n    currentFPS=fpsFrames/fpsTime;\n    fpsEl.textContent=`FPS: ${Math.round(currentFPS)}${adaptiveQuality && adaptiveResFactor<1?' [адапт.×'+adaptiveResFactor.toFixed(2)+']':''}`;\n    fpsFrames=0; fpsTime=0;\n    adaptQuality();\n  }\n  \n  if(playing) animT=Math.min(20,animT+dt*speed);\n\n  tSlider.value=animT;\n  tValEl.textContent=animT.toFixed(2);\n  timerEl.textContent=`t = ${animT.toFixed(2)}с`;\n\n  // Phase params\n  const pp = getPhaseParams(animT);\n  if(pp.phase !== lastPhase) {\n    lastPhase = pp.phase;\n    phaseEl.textContent = phaseDescs[pp.phase];\n    phaseDescEl.textContent = phaseDescs[pp.phase];\n  }\n\n  // Camera - slow auto-rotate with phase-based distance\n  if(!dragging) camTh+=dt*.15;\n  const effectiveD = camD + pp.camDOffset;\n\n  const cx=effectiveD*Math.cos(camPh)*Math.sin(camTh);\n  const cy=effectiveD*Math.sin(camPh);\n  const cz=effectiveD*Math.cos(camPh)*Math.cos(camTh);\n  mat.uniforms.uCamPos.value.set(cx,cy,cz);\n  mat.uniforms.uReveal.value=pp.reveal;\n  mat.uniforms.uDetailFade.value=pp.detailFade;\n  mat.uniforms.uGlow.value=pp.glow;\n\n  perspCam.fov=mat.uniforms.uFOV.value;\n  perspCam.position.set(cx,cy,cz);\n  perspCam.lookAt(0,0,0);\n  perspCam.aspect=window.innerWidth/window.innerHeight;\n  perspCam.updateProjectionMatrix();\n\n  accumulateParticles(animT, dt);\n\n  renderer.clear(true,true,true);\n  // 1. Background\n  renderer.render(bgScene, orthoCam);\n  // 2. Particles (behind fractal, visible where fractal is transparent)\n  if(showParts && totalParticles > 0) renderer.render(particleScene, perspCam);\n  // 3. Fractal with transparent background\n  renderer.render(fractalScene, orthoCam);\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n  updateRes();\n  perspCam.aspect=window.innerWidth/window.innerHeight;\n  perspCam.updateProjectionMatrix();\n});\n\nanimate();\n\n} // end init\n} // end startApp\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","thumbnail":"🌀","default_speed":4}